From: CEB-GNRD maintainers <bmc@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] webui: restore KVM layout after leaving fullscreen

Keep the toolbar constrained to its page container instead of copying the
fullscreen canvas width. Handle fullscreenchange, including Escape, and
notify noVNC after browser layout restoration. Cancel pending callbacks
when the component is removed and handle fullscreen API rejection.
Keep the toolbar on one line; scroll the actions within their column when
the viewport is too narrow instead of wrapping buttons or widening the page.

Size the embedded video panel to 70% of the available content width and
retain the remote aspect ratio. Popup and fullscreen panels use full width.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD board-specific]
